  "title": "Middleby To Present Growth Strategy at 2026 Investor Day Ahead of Transformative Business Separation",
  "summary": "Following the spin-off of Midera, Middleby will be comprised of the Commercial Foodservice segment and a 49% ownership stake in Composition Brands (formerly known as Middleby Residential Kitchen) while Midera will be comprised of the Food Processing segment. Each company will benefit from segment specific management teams, tailored capital allocation strategies, and even greater agility [...]",
